message: "If you use this theoretical preprint or its synthetic verifier, please cite it and preserve its limitations."
title: "Damage R0: A Next-Generation Theory of Aging in Interdependent Living Systems"
abstract: >-
  A multitype, age-dependent framework defines a damage reproduction operator
  from causal damage-generation rates and repair/turnover transitions. The
  paper states a local threshold condition, proposes a sensitivity-based
  control objective, and outlines uncertainty-aware comparative tests. All
  numerical results are synthetic; no biological dataset was analyzed.
